COMPILATION OF: E46M5

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M5

   1 a 0000 E46M5:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] MIXED LITERAL CLASSES IN ONE LIST, BOTH ORDERS: a
   4 a 0006      CHARACTER literal and a DECIMAL literal. The two chains end in
   5 a 0006      different tails (?PNCOP for a character item, ?PNVOP for a
   6 a 0006      numeric one), so this pins which tail follows which item, and
   7 a 0006      that the ?QIOOP still follows BOTH. */
   8 c 0006   dcl outf file;
   9 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M5OUT DAT');
  10 c 0023   put file(outf) list('X=',42);
  11 c 004F   put file(outf) list(42,'X=');
  12 c 007B   close file(outf);
  13 a 0081 end E46M5;

CODE SIZE = 0084
DATA AREA = 000D
FREE SYMS = 3883
END  COMPILATION
